          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.7,
          "end": 12.8,
          "en": "You learned that you can use translate to move the element around on the different axis.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.89,
          "end": 19.22,
          "en": "You learn about scale, rotate and skew and that these functions can be applied as values on the transform",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.22,
          "end": 25.21,
          "en": "property to change the look of your element just as you need it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 25.28,
          "end": 30.32,
          "en": "You learned that 3D transformations are possible via the z-axis or for the rotate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 30.32,
          "end": 31.34,
          "en": "actually via the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 31.36,
          "end": 35.67,
          "en": "x and y-axis due to the way elements rotate around axis",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 35.93,
          "end": 43.85,
          "en": "and that you can use transform origin and transform style to change how your elements actually transform.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 44,
          "end": 45.81,
          "en": "You also learned about perspective,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 45.89,
          "end": 52.31,
          "en": "very useful for 3D animations and that this allows you to define the perspective or the distance from",
          "zh": ""
