          "end": 54.71,
          "en": "the object of the viewer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 54.71,
          "end": 60.08,
          "en": "You also learned about perspective origin which allows you to manipulate the origin of the viewer, which",
          "zh": ""
        },
